  "chartSunAries": "You have a brave, bright spark. You shine when you start something new, and your courage can be gentle too.",
  "chartSunTaurus": "You are steady, warm and loyal. You glow when life feels cozy, and slow, patient steps are a strength.",
  "chartSunGemini": "You are curious, playful and quick with words. Your many sides are not a flaw, they are your charm.",
  "chartSunCancer": "You feel deeply and care for others with a soft heart. Your sensitivity is a gift, and you deserve the same tenderness.",
  "chartSunLeo": "You carry a warm, sunny presence. You love to shine and to cheer others on, and you are enough even on quiet days.",
  "chartSunVirgo": "You are thoughtful, caring and good with details. You are allowed to be kind to yourself, even when things are not perfect.",
  "chartSunLibra": "You bring balance, beauty and gentle harmony wherever you go. Your own needs matter as much as everyone else's.",
  "chartSunScorpio": "You feel things with depth and you are loyal to the core. Your intensity is a strength, and you can soften when you are ready.",
  "chartSunSagittarius": "You are adventurous, honest and full of hope. You grow whenever you follow your curiosity.",
  "chartSunCapricorn": "You are patient, determined and dependable. You can rest and still be proud of how far you have come.",
  "chartSunAquarius": "You are original, kind and a little bit dreamy. Your different way of seeing things is what makes you special.",
  "chartSunPisces": "You are gentle, imaginative and full of compassion. Your dreams are worth protecting, and so is your peace.",
  "chartMoonAries": "Your feelings arrive fast and bright. Give yourself a moment to breathe, and let your heart move at its own pace.",
  "chartMoonTaurus": "You feel safest with comfort and calm. Cozy routines, good food and soft things help your heart settle.",
  "chartMoonGemini": "Talking, writing or sharing helps you understand how you feel. It is okay if your moods change like the sky.",
  "chartMoonCancer": "You feel everything deeply, and home is where your heart rests. Be as gentle with yourself as you are with others.",
  "chartMoonLeo": "Your heart loves to be seen and appreciated. Kind words, from others and from you, help you glow.",
  "chartMoonVirgo": "You feel calm when things are tidy and useful. You can let small worries go, because you are doing well.",
  "chartMoonLibra": "You feel best when things are peaceful and fair. It is okay to say what you need, even when it feels hard.",
  "chartMoonScorpio": "Your feelings run deep and private. You can take your time before opening up, and trust those who have earned it.",
  "chartMoonSagittarius": "You feel free when you have space and hope. A walk, a laugh or a little adventure lifts your mood.",
  "chartMoonCapricorn": "You may keep your feelings close and tend to them quietly. Soft rest is just as important as hard work.",
  "chartMoonAquarius": "You make sense of feelings by stepping back and thinking them through. Your heart is warm even when it is quiet.",
  "chartMoonPisces": "Your heart is soft and picks up on every mood around you. Quiet time, music and dreaming help you recharge.",
  "chartRisingAries": "People may see you as bold, energetic and ready to go. Your confidence invites others to be brave too.",
  "chartRisingTaurus": "People may see you as calm, grounded and warm. Your steady presence makes others feel at ease.",
  "chartRisingGemini": "People may see you as bright, curious and easy to talk to. Your lively energy is a joy to be around.",
  "chartRisingCancer": "People may see you as gentle and caring. Your kindness makes others feel at home.",
  "chartRisingLeo": "People may see you as warm, confident and a little bit sparkly. Your presence lights up a room.",
  "chartRisingVirgo": "People may see you as thoughtful, neat and kind. Your quiet care shows in the little things.",
  "chartRisingLibra": "People may see you as graceful, friendly and easygoing. Your charm helps others feel welcome.",
  "chartRisingScorpio": "People may see you as calm, magnetic and a little mysterious. Your depth makes others curious.",
  "chartRisingSagittarius": "People may see you as cheerful, open and adventurous. Your optimism is contagious.",
  "chartRisingCapricorn": "People may see you as composed, capable and wise. Your calm focus earns trust.",
  "chartRisingAquarius": "People may see you as unique, friendly and a bit unexpected. Your originality stands out in a lovely way.",
