  "aboutZodiacBody": "Mochi Moon uses the Western tropical zodiac. Your Sun, Moon and Rising signs are worked out from your birthday, and the Moon phase and retrograde dates follow the real sky.",
  "aboutWritingTitle": "How readings are written",
  "aboutWritingBody": "Daily readings are written ahead of time with the help of AI, in a soft and encouraging tone. There is no chat: nobody types questions to an AI here.",
  "aboutCareTitle": "What we leave out",
  "aboutCareBody": "Readings never predict health, death, pregnancy, money or legal outcomes, and they never say a relationship will fail or succeed. For anything like that, please talk to someone you trust or a qualified professional.",
